# About ISG

## Who We Are

ISG (formerly Interstate Companies) is a multi-discipline architecture, engineering, and planning firm that provides professional services across multiple markets. Founded in 1973, ISG has grown to become one of the Midwest's leading A&E firms.

## Our Practice Areas

- Architecture
- Engineering (Civil, Structural, Mechanical, Electrical)
- Planning
- Telecommunications
- Environmental
- Surveying & Geospatial

## Our Team

ISG employs approximately 500 professionals across our offices in Minnesota, Iowa, Wisconsin, and Illinois. Our telecommunications division has grown significantly in recent years to meet the demand for fiber network design and deployment services.

## Our Offices

- **Mankato, MN** (Headquarters)
- Willmar, MN
- Duluth, MN
- Rochester, MN
- Des Moines, IA
- Dubuque, IA
- Green Bay, WI
- Rockford, IL

## Our Mission

